<title>VENEZUELA: Venprecar Q1 net rises 13 percent.</title>
<headline>Venprecar Q1 net rises 13 percent.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 1.3 billion bolivars vs 1.1 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Net sales 10.3 billion bolivars vs 7.4 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Cost of sales 7.1 bln bolivars vs 5.8 bln bolivars</p>
<p>General expenses 797 million bolivars vs 620 million</p>
<p>Financing cost/gain 1.2 bln bolivar loss vs 247 million gain</p>
<p>Other income, net 331 million bolivars vs 31 million bolivars</p>
<p>Notes: Period ends December 31 1996.</p>
<p>Results are in constant December 31 1996 bolivars</p>
<p>Venprecar produces hot briquetted iron producer and is a subsidiary of Sivensa</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
